# Swarm live Redis — upgraded 2026-09-06 from 3.0.504 to 8.10.1
# 3.0.504 MSI uninstalled. 8.10.1 installed to C:\Program Files\Redis (MSYS2 build).
# Security: bind 127.0.0.1, protected-mode yes, requirepass set.
# Service: scheduled task "Redis8" runs start-redis.bat on logon (MSYS2 service-install bug).
# Redis password: see .omniroute/.env or ask user.
REDIS_URL=redis://127.0.0.1:6379/0
# Full streams (XADD/XLEN/XREAD) now available on 8.10.1 — no more degraded mode.
# CI uses redis:7-alpine — compatible with 8.10.1.
# Persistence: RDB snapshots only (dump.rdb, gitignored). AOF NOT enabled.
